 "how_greens_were_identified": "BY THE DATA, decisively: cross-matched star magnitudes between every channel pair. The two greens are the same filter on the same scene, so their pair must agree at ~0 offset with the smallest scatter. Measured on frame 1: ch0-ch3 gives median dmag -0.005, MAD 0.115, over 706 matches, against 0.28-0.85 mag offsets and ~2x the scatter for every other pair.",
